Everything in this directory - every YAML file describing a platform, data
source or tool - is dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0.

To the extent possible under law, the contributors to this repository have
waived all copyright and related or neighbouring rights to the contents of
data/. You can copy it, change it, redistribute it, and build a commercial
product on it, without asking and without attribution.

Full text: https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/legalcode
Summary:   https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/

Attribution isn't required, but it is appreciated, and a link back helps other
people find corrections.

Note that this covers the data describing these resources, not the resources
themselves. Each dataset, feed and tool listed here carries its own licence,
and several carry none at all - which the entries say so you find out before
you build on them, not after.
